  "apiLevel": 7,
  "contentDescription": "Two identical sets of concentric circles with their centres slightly apart. The broad dark bands sweeping across the square are moire fringes \u2014 interference between the two sets, not drawn by anything in the document. Drag to pull the centres further apart and crowd the fringes together."
